# Summary
In summary, this project helped me get hands-on experience on learning and use SQL queries in order to filter and search for tables from datapools. I was able to use these commands to find specific login attempts from the time, date, and location, and be able to search and find the amount of employees there were in specific departments and offices. These skills are crucial for learning and understanding what it takes to be in the cybersecurity department because it shows efficiency and high analytical skills while preventing any attacks searching through logs.
